{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52883","headline":"同房侍御竹园新亭与邢大判官同游 · 张垍","name":"同房侍御竹园新亭与邢大判官同游","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"隐隐春城东，朦胧陈近深。\n君子顾榛莽，兴言伤古今。\n决河道新流，疎迳踪旧林。\n开亭俯川陆，时景宜招寻。\n肃穆逢使轩，寅犹事登临。\n忝游芝兰下，还对桃李阴。\n峯远白波来，气喧黄鸟吟。\n因覩歌颂作，始知经济心。\n灌（疑）坛（疑）县（小川环树疑此字涉下文而衍）有遗风，单父多鸣琴。\n谁得久州县，苍生怀德音。\n（日本藏唐抄本《新撰类林抄》卷四）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张垍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52883.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52883","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}